      "mergeID": "66c5f6aa148ba47226a10fda",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I am experiencing an issue where gesture bindings are no longer functioning on my PICO 4 Pro. I have attempted the following troubleshooting steps:\n\nNavigated to Settings > Controls.\n\nTurned off the last two options.\n\nEnabled legacy gestures in the circular menu.\n\nResult:\n\nThis configuration has only partially resolved the issue, allowing for just one or, at most, a few gestures to work intermittently.\n\nImpact:\n\nGestures are effectively non-functional, severely impacting usability.\n\nAdditional Information:\n\nI have confirmed with four other users who own the Quest 2, and they are experiencing similar issues with expressions not working.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Gesture Bindings Not Functioning on PICO 4 Pro and Quest 2",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "66ad2323b5f24c6b470186b7",
