      },
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My Pico Neo 3 also encountered the same issue, turning off all switches related to SteamVR in the VRC settings and restoring some gesture animations. But it's still not exactly the same as before, and each hand has at least two gesture animations that cannot be triggered. I can't understand how this update passed the check.",
